{
  "name": "@prismshadow/penguin-library-agent",
  "version": "0.2.20",
  "description": "The agent domain: the AgentConfig and Memory mechanisms and their services (the Web App's Agent config, vault, skills/schedules prompt templates and Memory tabs), the Agent package import/export/zip caps, the avatar plumbing and the API vocabulary. One package, no server dependencies — the server imports these; nothing here imports the server. Its web half (./web, the Agent settings pages) is TypeScript source the Web App compiles with itself.",
